  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nEmbrace the future of ease in a clever architect-designed home where intelligent technology brings energy savings to beat the cost of living. Sleek design, generous proportions and a flowing layout deliver instant feel-good factor that grabs your attention. But it’s the clever, less obvious features that truly set this property apart.\r\n\r\nDesigned by MCooper Architects, this 4-year old, 262sqm brick and cedar home harnesses internet connected solar panels and an optimised 3-phase inverter, with integrated load control to deliver impressive annual savings. Everyday living is elevated by features like ducted air con, CCTV, surround sound, Wi-Fi-connected\r\nappliances, KEF ceiling speakers, (and THX certified subwoofers), multi-EV charging in the double garage, as well as a concealed automatic pool cover.\r\n\r\nExpansive indoor-outdoor living revolves around the courtyard where a large deck shelters beneath a louvred canopy beside the heated pool. Watch children splashing from the Studio Italia-designed kitchen and scullery with granite island and 2 Bosch ovens. A separate laundry, double garage, guest wc and substantial games/media\r\nroom provide practical convenience and a private retreat from the action.\r\n\r\nOn the quieter upper level, there’s a family bathroom and 4 double bedrooms with generous wardrobes. Most rooms enjoy lovely views over Churchill Park, just up the road. The master suite is a sunny sanctuary with vaulted ceiling and a spacious walk-in wardrobe plus ensuite. Heated bathroom floors and quiet, high-performance Schweigen extractor fans add another layer of thoughtful refinement throughout.\r\n\r\nIn a peaceful no-exit street with Churchill Park School and the park at the end, this is smart, resilient and sustainable living with family comfort firmly in mind. Step into the future and make this exceptional intelligent home your next move.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
